=3 Notes
* The Immortals and Raubahn will not spawn until you talk to the Captain NPC at the start, they will spawn at the top of (I-6).
* If the Hume Captain NPC, {n:Shailham}, is defeated you lose the assault immediately.
* You lose points for each of your red team NPCs that are defeated.
* All of your NPCs are Black Mages, all of the Immortals are Blue Mages and cast spells accordingly.
* The two teams are comprised of the following NPC's:
** Red Team, the Inexorables.
*** {n:Shailham}: Captain
**** {n:Dhiadjhar}, {n:Zhadjaraf}, {n:Ganmuul}, {n:Jalyaat}, {n:Rahdjab}, {n:Ghahnis}, {n:Tahbmar}, {n:Rhushouf}.
** Blue Team, the Immortals.
*** {n:Raubahn}: Captain
**** Ghayaraan, Krinahal, Varajahl, Mareyamad, Shayaam, Habraheem, Qudeen, Salyhaar.
**** Sharayaan, Ubdeen, Bashdeel, Wharadi, Hkadouf, Afrhaad, {n:Nareema}, Udhaaman, Yhalbin.

=2 Walkthrough
* The assault is won once Raubahn dies.
** At 99, you can send a DD party member to (I-6), who can kill Raubahn when he spawns in the middle of the lower area and end the assault.
** At 75, the plan was:
*** Buff at the start.
*** Send a puller / DD north, while the buffer stays at the start.
*** Buffer triggers the NPCs when everyone is in place.
*** The puller aggros Raubahn's group and pull them south with movement speed.
*** The DD pulls Raubahn out of the crowd / kills him while the puller runs and the buffer keeps the start NPCs alive.
*** Buffer exits.
* If you are going to take a long time, you should have somebody looking after the NPCs, particularly the {p:Hume} NPC.

